- [alerts-repository-audit.test.ts](tests/alerts-repository-audit.test.ts) — now **requires** `DATABASE_URL` and skips cleanly when absent (never falls back to the shared dev DB); fixtures use per-run unique emails; `SKIP_DB_TESTS=1` escape hatch. This was the root cause of the "failing database test" — its default connection string was the shared `medorch-postgres` container.
