- **Step 2b `--persist`:** written to [docs/design-system/medorch/MASTER.md](docs/design-system/medorch/MASTER.md) (skill's master + page-overrides structure; `pages/` folder ready for per-page overrides).
- **Step 3 domain searches:** `--domain ux` → dense-table handling (overflow-x-auto / card fallback), line-height 1.5–1.75, focusable error summary linked to fields (High severity), inline validation on blur (High); `--domain color` → Healthcare App / Patient Portal palettes cross-checked.
- **Step 4 `--stack nextjs`** → App Router routing guidance retrieved.
