## 2. Current frontend analysis

Tailwind **v4** (no config; `@theme inline`), one [globals.css](src/app/globals.css) with an existing token layer (`--primary #1769e0`, surfaces, semantics, radius). **No fonts loaded** (system stack; "Inter" named but never fetched). **No icon library** — hand-drawn inline `<svg>` in 8 files (Sidebar alone has 10). 22 pages, some very large (landing 998 lines, `DoctorDirectory` 945, `PatientRegistry` 705). Shared primitives exist: `Button`, `Badge`, `Card`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorState`, `LoadingState`; `AppShell`/`Header`/`Sidebar` are small. Hard constraints from existing tests: `tests/accessibility.test.tsx` (5) locks schedule button visible text, `aria-expanded` + label swap on the header toggle, and `Sidebar.PRIMARY_NAVIGATION_ID`; `tests/me-read-handlers.test.ts` (9) locks component API responses.

## 3. MedOrch design-system proposal

**Style — Minimalism & Swiss** (skill-verified): grid-based, high contrast, functional, restrained. Density 8/10 for the console, motion 2/10 (CSS-only, **GSAP snippet deliberately not adopted** — no new animation dependency; skill's dial says subtle).

**Palette (every ratio measured):**

| Role | Hex | Measured |
|---|---|---|
| Primary / on-primary | `#1E40AF` / `#FFF` | **8.72:1** — primary action color |
| Primary hover/active | `#172554` | 14.69:1 |
| Accent (attention/urgent, dark ink only) | `#D97706` / `#000` | 6.59:1 — **never white-on-amber (3.19 ✗)** |
| Sidebar navy / on-navy | `#1E3A8A` / `#FFF` | 10.36:1; inactive `#CBD5E1` 6.98; amber active `#FBBF24` 6.20 |
| Background / card / muted | `#F8FAFC` / `#FFF` / `#E9EEF6` | — |
| Heading / body / muted / subtle text | `#1E3A8A` / `#334155` / `#475569` / `#64748B` | 10.36 / 10.35 / 7.24 / **4.76** |
| Success (fill+ink) | `#047857` on `#ECFDF5` | 5.48 / 5.21 (raw `#12B76A` was 3.77 ✗ → replaced) |
| Warning ink | `#B45309` on `#FFFBEB` | 4.84 |
| Danger (fill `#DC2626`+white / ink `#B91C1C`) | on `#FEF2F2` | 4.83 / 6.47 (raw on-soft 4.41 ✗ → darkened) |
| Info | `#0369A1` on `#F0F9FF` | 5.93 / 5.57 (raw `#0284C7` 4.10 ✗ → darkened) |
| Input control border | `#74829A` | **3.89:1** (meets 3:1 non-text; current `#d0d5dd` 1.36 ✗) |
| Card edge / divider (decorative) | `#CBD5E1` / `#E2E8F0` | exempt, but visible in both surfaces |

**Typography** — deviation from the generated file, documented with reason: **Fira Sans** for all UI/headings (generated pairing's body font; monospaced headings would hurt scan-ability and hierarchy), **Fira Code 500 for tabular numerics only** (times, patient codes, IDs, metrics) — preserving the pairing's "data precision" intent. Loaded via `next/font` (self-hosted, no runtime Google fetch — I'll verify against `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing it, per AGENTS.md). Scale: 12/14/16/18/20/24/30/36, body leading 1.5–1.625 (skill UX rule).

**Component rules** — buttons 36/40px heights, blue primary, blue-outline secondary, `cursor:pointer`, focus-visible 2px ring, no layout-shifting transforms; cards white + `#CBD5E1` edge, elevation only when interactive; inputs always labeled, `#74829A` border + blue focus ring, errors inline via `aria-describedby`, validate on blur; tables in `overflow-x-auto` with sticky header and Fira Code numerics; status = **color + text label always** (never color alone), using the soft/ink pairs above; dialogs = scrim + focus trap + Escape; loading = skeletons on data surfaces, keeping existing `LoadingState`/`ErrorState`/`EmptyState` semantics.

**Anti-patterns (from MASTER + app-specific):** emojis as icons; white-on-amber; gray text below 4.5:1; status by color alone; layout-shifting hover/scale; invisible focus; ad-hoc per-page hex (tokens only); GSAP/heavy motion; unsanctioned dark mode (out of scope — light only, token structure leaves the door open); and no giant rewrite.

